# Install-ArtTune.ps1 carries an Authenticode signature that covers the exact
# file bytes, CRLF line endings included. Git must not normalize it: with
# core.autocrlf the blob would be stored as LF, and anyone fetching the raw
# file from GitHub would get a HashMismatch "file may have been tampered
# with" warning. -text disables all conversion so the signed bytes round-trip.
*.ps1 -text

# Library configs and target curves are consumed byte-for-byte by Equalizer APO
# and are hashed by the build; leave them alone too.
library/** -text

# Binaries
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.lnk binary
